{"unit_id":"576576__dsh-translate#card-zh","repo":"576576/dsh-translate","commit":"5ab4fb803e5449c464807a7044e5793d24e8f91b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-translate 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的翻译模式插件。它通过 Agent 预设指示模型仅返回译文，并从本地设置读取源语言、目标语言和翻译风格；输入框工具行提供语言选择、方向交换和风格设置，设置页还可管理首选语言及风格预设。语言菜单支持搜索和添加自定义语言，目标语言自动模式按界面语言决定翻译方向。适合需要在 DSH 会话中快速切换翻译方向、保持术语表达风格的用户。设置保存在 DSH 主机本地，不需要额外 API Key 或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-39","lib/client.js:417-515","lib/index.js:123-173","lib/store.js:31-40"]}
{"unit_id":"576576__dsh-translate#card-en","repo":"576576/dsh-translate","commit":"5ab4fb803e5449c464807a7044e5793d24e8f91b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-translate adds translation mode to the DSH web client. Its preset asks for translation only. The composer offers language selection, swapping, custom languages, and style presets. Automatic mode follows the interface language. Settings stay on the DSH host; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-39","lib/client.js:417-515","lib/index.js:123-173","lib/store.js:31-40"]}
